  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - APPROVE",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 3 - All new external finishes in respect of all the works hereby approved (and any other incidental works to be carried out in this connection) shall match the existing building in",
    "Condition : 4 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority (before the building(s) is/are occupied/used).",
    "Condition : 5 - No development shall take place until samples of the materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the 2 storey rear extension to the dental surgery hereby permitted (brick work; roof coverings, and external cladding to the rear outbuilding) shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority before commencement of works and the approved details shall be implemented and maintained thereafter.",
    "Condition : 6 - No additional flank windows or other glazed openings shall be formed in the side (east and west) and rear (north) elevation walls of all the extensions hereby approved without the prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 7 - Full details at scale 1:5 (including sections) of the proposed lantern rooflights shall be submitted and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the commencement of works.",
    "Condition : 8 - Full details of the structural support for the proposed overhanging first floor and parapet wall of the two-storey side extension shall be submitted and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the commencement of works."
